it for the quarter, despite a 12.6% fall in total income. Real estate sales soared to \u20b91,827 crore, largely driven by the launch of 2.4 million sq ft of new projects valued at approximately \u20b93,000 crore. Positive contributions from leasing and hospitality bolstered their financial standing, with a net worth of \u20b96,517.47 crore as of September 30, 2026.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/brigade-enterprises-net-profit-rises-29-to-218-82-crore-in-q2-fy27/135314474?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-225206/135314474.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}